c source/matching/game/s20/s20_adjust_b.c
w3d_s20_forward_base_pair_801aab20|0x801aab20|Appears to pass two item sub-addresses and a base subobject field to a helper, then forward this and the item to another helper.
w3d_s20_set_base_mode_801d5700|0x801d5700|Appears to store two bits of an item's flags into the secondary base subobject's mode field unless that mode is 1, and returns zero.
w3d_s20_virtual_item_801ac378|0x801ac378|Appears to call virtual method 16 of the secondary base subobject with the item address plus 20 and returns zero.
w3d_s20_flush_base_8016bf68|0x8016bf68|Appears to call a helper on the secondary base subobject when its field at offset 200 is nonzero, and returns zero.
w3d_s20_call_keep_base_field_801aaf6c|0x801aaf6c|Appears to set the secondary base subobject field at offset 164 to the argument during a helper call, then restore it, returning the helper result.
w3d_s20_scoped_base_range_80168a9c|0x80168a9c|Appears to publish a sub-record of the item in the secondary base subobject during a helper call, then clear the pointer.
w3d_s20_dispatch_base_target_80166b14|0x80166b14|Appears to call virtual method 6 of the object held at offset 44 of the secondary base subobject and returns 1 when there is no such object.
w3d_s20_virtual_chain_item_801ac3bc|0x801ac3bc|Appears to fetch an object through virtual method 13 of the secondary base subobject, then pass it the item address plus 20 through its virtual method 21.
w3d_s20_flush_base_scaled_8016bfb0|0x8016bfb0|Appears to flush the secondary base subobject when its field at offset 200 is set, then pass the helper result, an item float and 2 to another helper.
w3d_s20_dispatch_temp_801a5c48|0x801a5c48|Appears to build a temporary record from the item's linked record and pass it to virtual method 19 of the secondary base subobject.
